# vew_pipeline (Resource)

Manages an image pipeline using a released recipe version. Create and update
wait for VEW to report `CREATED`; delete retires the pipeline. Configuring a
pipeline does not build an image. Invoke `vew_image_build` separately when a
build is intended.

